{"id":"n55368-1-10","stage":5,"title":"맹세 · 盟誓","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55368-1-10-1","ko":"우리 이제 헤어져요.","zh":"我们分手吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"헤어져요.","meaning":"分手，分开，走开","explanation":"헤어지다：分手，分开，走开；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"헤어지다","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58271","senseId":"2","lemma":"헤어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"说话的同时。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"55df2acaad2147f2","term":"헤어지다","zh":"分手，分开，走开","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3","entryId":"58271","definition":"和亲近的人切断关系。","pronunciation":["헤어지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/23dd96866965418e6079.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55368-1-10-2","ko":"영원히 함께하겠다고 한 우리 맹세를 저버리지 마세요.","zh":"别违背我们永远在一起的誓言。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"영원히","meaning":"永远地","explanation":"영원히：永远地","readings":[{"term":"영원히","audio":"/audio/2b7f231dfef136838715.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14099","senseId":"1","lemma":"영원히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"함께하겠다고","meaning":"一起来，一起做，共同","explanation":"함께하다：一起来，一起做，共同；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"함께하다","audio":"/audio/cfbe25f214eb09b4652c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84261","senseId":"1","lemma":"함께하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맹세를","meaning":"盟誓","explanation":"맹세：盟誓；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"맹세","audio":"/audio/eec4c74908bd84688d62.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55368","senseId":"1","lemma":"맹세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저버리지","meaning":"背弃，违背","explanation":"저버리다：背弃，违背；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"저버리다","audio":"/audio/e2dccc8829b019c3184d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74865","senseId":"1","lemma":"저버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마세요.","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2b7f231dfef13683","term":"영원히","zh":"永远地","audio":"/audio/2b7f231dfef136838715.mp3","entryId":"14099","definition":"持续不终止的状态；或到任何时候都不变的状态。","pronunciation":["영ː원히"]},{"id":"cfbe25f214eb09b4","term":"함께하다","zh":"一起来，一起做，共同","audio":"/audio/cfbe25f214eb09b4652c.mp3","entryId":"84261","definition":"和别人一起做某事，度过一段时间。","pronunciation":["함께하다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"eec4c74908bd8468","term":"맹세","zh":"盟誓","audio":"/audio/eec4c74908bd84688d62.mp3","entryId":"55368","definition":"发重誓或郑重承诺。","pronunciation":["맹세"]},{"id":"e2dccc8829b019c3","term":"저버리다","zh":"背弃，违背","audio":"/audio/e2dccc8829b019c3184d.mp3","entryId":"74865","definition":"忘记或违反应当遵守的道理或道义。","pronunciation":["저버리다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0ea97adccd94b698f9cc.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.329,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=55368","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":176,"sequenceScore":3.8057,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["别违背我们永远在一起的誓言。","我们分手吧。","最近您的病情好像变得更严重了？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我们分手吧。","最近您的病情好像变得更严重了？","别违背我们永远在一起的誓言。"],"answer":2}]}
